	(text "To use with bulb (recommended):\n* Bridge Jumper JP1\n* Skip D1\n* Place 1.5V bulb on D2\n* Use 3v3 out regulator for U1\n* Populate all other components as listed\n* Tune R1 until performance satisfactory\n* Supply from 2xAA or 2xAAA batteries\n\nTo use with LEDs (not recommended):\n* Open Jumper JP1\n* Populate R2 and R3 with 47-68R\n* Use 5v regulator for U1\n* Adjust R1 until stable.\n* Higher values of R2/R3 makes LEDs dimmer, but also heating element\n  less hot, therefore circuit less stable\n* Supply from 2xAA or 2xAAA batteries"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 59.69 0)
		(effects
